# Path-scoped OPSEC allowlist (gitignore-style, committed + reviewable).
# Secret scans still run on these files; only the identifier-pattern scan is
# waived for the paths below.
#
# site/viewer/episode.curt — Fleetcast episode transcript. Speaker names are
# the podcast's public cast: they are spoken in the published audio at
# audio.jordannewell.com/episodes/, which this transcript verbatim reflects.
# Nothing added beyond what is broadcast.
site/viewer/episode.curt

# website/static/viewer/episode.curt — same file carried into the docs-env
# static tree (website/); identical justification: the transcript verbatim
# reflects the published broadcast cast. Secret scans still run on it.
website/static/viewer/episode.curt
